---Contains a fact that GuardDuty noted about your environment during an investigation, such as the affected resource, the activity on that resource, or your detection coverage. The record contains at most one of the payload members, the one that matches ObservationType. Indicators can accompany any observation type.
---@class aws.guardduty.ObservationRecord
---@field ObservationType aws.guardduty.ObservationType The kind of observation. The value identifies the payload member that can be set: FINDING_DETAIL (FindingDetail), RESOURCE (Resource), NETWORK_ACTIVITY (NetworkActivity), RDS_LOGIN_ACTIVITY (RdsLoginActivity), S3_ACTIVITY (S3Activity), KUBERNETES_ACTIVITY (KubernetesActivity), MALWARE_SCAN (MalwareScan), RELATED_FINDINGS (RelatedFindings), DETECTION_COVERAGE (DetectionCoverage), ACCOUNT_OVERVIEW (...
---@field FindingDetail? aws.guardduty.FindingDetail Details about a GuardDuty finding. Set when ObservationType is FINDING_DETAIL.
---@field Resource? aws.guardduty.InvestigationResource Details about an affected resource. Set when ObservationType is RESOURCE.
---@field NetworkActivity? aws.guardduty.NetworkActivity Details about network activity. Set when ObservationType is NETWORK_ACTIVITY.
---@field RdsLoginActivity? aws.guardduty.RdsLoginActivity Details about login activity on an Amazon RDS database. Set when ObservationType is RDS_LOGIN_ACTIVITY.
---@field S3Activity? aws.guardduty.S3Activity Details about Amazon S3 activity. Set when ObservationType is S3_ACTIVITY.
---@field KubernetesActivity? aws.guardduty.KubernetesActivity Details about Kubernetes activity. Set when ObservationType is KUBERNETES_ACTIVITY.
---@field MalwareScan? aws.guardduty.InvestigationMalwareScan Details about a malware scan. Set when ObservationType is MALWARE_SCAN.
---@field RelatedFindings? aws.guardduty.RelatedFindings Details about findings that are related to the investigated activity. Set when ObservationType is RELATED_FINDINGS.
---@field DetectionCoverage? aws.guardduty.DetectionCoverage Details about your detection coverage. Set when ObservationType is DETECTION_COVERAGE.
---@field AccountOverview? aws.guardduty.AccountOverview Overview information about an account. Set when ObservationType is ACCOUNT_OVERVIEW.
---@field Recommendations? aws.guardduty.Recommendations Recommended actions. Set when ObservationType is RECOMMENDATION.
---@field RuntimeSignals? aws.guardduty.RuntimeSignals A summary of runtime signals. Set when ObservationType is RUNTIME_SIGNALS.
---@field Distribution? aws.guardduty.Distribution A breakdown of findings along one dimension. Set when ObservationType is DISTRIBUTION.
---@field RepresentativeResources? aws.guardduty.RepresentativeFindings Representative findings for the affected resources, one finding for each resource. Set when ObservationType is REPRESENTATIVE_RESOURCE.
---@field Indicators? aws.guardduty.InvestigationIndicators The threat indicators associated with the observation, such as an IP address, a domain, or a file hash.

---@alias aws.guardduty.ObservationTexts aws.guardduty.String[]

